- W0702 gone with the bare except removed in the Bandit commit.
- C0116/C0114: add module and function docstrings.
- C0103: rename logConflicts -> log_conflicts.
- C0206/C0209: iterate with .values() and use f-strings.
- W1514/R1732: open files with encoding="utf-8" inside `with`.
- W0612: drop unused variables in main(); guard main() with __name__.
